{
  "run_id": "PMC11077685__broad__oracle_targetpack_b_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 1 at.% Hf to a refractory high-entropy alloy will improve its high-temperature oxygen resistance.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf addition promotes in situ formation of a dense, self-healing oxide scale that limits oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An oxygen-free equimolar Ti-V-Nb-Ta alloy can have a single-phase BCC structure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10708198::web::014::mechanisms_underpinning_age_softening_in"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed improvement should occur during exposure to air at approximately 800°C for up to 24 hours.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-modified alloy will form a continuous and adherent oxide layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide layer will be enriched in Hf and may contain HfO2.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The continuous oxide layer acts as an oxygen-diffusion barrier.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC6804173::web::010::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hafnium acts as an oxygen scavenger in the proposed alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf is expected to reduce oxygen diffusivity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf is expected to reduce oxygen solubility in the alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf promotes rapid reformation and densification of the protective oxide scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduced oxygen transport and scale reformation will reduce oxygen ingress and delay internal oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 800°C in air, the Hf-containing alloy will exhibit approximately 20–30% lower oxidation mass gain than the untreated alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-containing alloy will show less oxide-scale cracking and spallation than the untreated alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under the same oxidation conditions, the untreated alloy will form a more porous and less protective oxide scale with higher oxygen uptake.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The magnitude of the Hf effect may differ at substantially lower or higher temperatures or in atmospheres other than air.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
